<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Shorts 후보 보고서 - {{ generated_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M') }}</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --background: #f4f6f8;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #18202a;
      --muted: #5f6b78;
      --line: #d9dfe6;
      --accent: #006d77;
      --accent-soft: #e2f2f2;
      --warn: #8a4b00;
      --warn-soft: #fff1d6;
      --danger: #a11b26;
      --danger-soft: #ffe8ea;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: "Segoe UI", "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    header {
      background: #16212b;
      color: #fff;
      border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent);
    }
    .header-inner, main {
      width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .header-inner { padding: 28px 0 24px; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0; }
    .run-meta { margin: 7px 0 0; color: #c7d1da; font-size: 14px; }
    main { padding: 24px 0 48px; }
    .status {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
      background: var(--surface);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .status.warning { border-left-color: var(--warn); background: var(--warn-soft); }
    .status.error { border-left-color: var(--danger); background: var(--danger-soft); }
    .status strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 3px; }
    .status p { margin: 0; }
    .summary {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .metric { padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
    .metric span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .metric strong { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size: 22px; }
    .candidate-list { display: grid; gap: 16px; }
    article {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    article.high { border-color: #dc7b84; }
    .candidate-head {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .rank {
      flex: 0 0 36px;
      height: 36px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #16212b;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .source { margin-top: 4px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    .candidate-body { padding: 16px 18px 18px; }
    .candidate-body h3 { margin: 16px 0 4px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0; }
    .candidate-body h3:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
    .candidate-body p { margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; }
    .hook { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; }
    .scores {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .score { padding: 9px 8px; text-align: center; background: #f0f3f5; }
    .score span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
    .score strong { font-size: 18px; }
    .risk-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 16px; }
    .risk {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 3px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .risk.medium { color: var(--warn); border-color: #d9a151; background: var(--warn-soft); }
    .risk.high { color: var(--danger); border-color: #dc7b84; background: var(--danger-soft); }
    ul { margin: 7px 0 0; padding-left: 20px; }
    .original {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 16px;
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .original:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .fallback-stats { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; margin-top: 14px; color: var(--muted); }
    footer { margin-top: 28px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .header-inner, main { width: min(100% - 20px, 1080px); }
      h1 { font-size: 23px; }
      .summary { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .scores { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .candidate-head { padding: 14px; }
      .candidate-body { padding: 14px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="header-inner">
      <h1>DCInside Shorts 후보</h1>
      <p class="run-meta">실행 {{ run_id }} · {{ generated_at.strftime('%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S KST') }}</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    {% if status == 'success' %}
    <section class="status">
      <strong>Codex 평가 완료</strong>
      <p>규칙 기반 후보 중 Codex가 최종 {{ final_candidate_count }}개를 선정했습니다.</p>
    </section>
    {% elif status == 'codex_fallback' %}
    <section class="status warning">
      <strong>Codex 평가가 실패하여 규칙 기반 임시 후보가 표시되었습니다.</strong>
      <p>{{ codex_error or '세부 내용은 실행 로그를 확인하세요.' }}</p>
    </section>
    {% elif status == 'insufficient_candidates' %}
    <section class="status warning">
      <strong>평가할 후보가 설정한 {{ final_candidate_count }}개보다 적습니다.</strong>
      <p>Codex를 호출하지 않았고, 수집된 규칙 기반 후보만 표시합니다.</p>
    </section>
    {% else %}
    <section class="status error">
      <strong>실행을 완료하지 못했습니다.</strong>
      <p>{{ codex_error or '세부 내용은 실행 로그를 확인하세요.' }}</p>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <section class="summary" aria-label="실행 요약">
      <div class="metric"><span>수집 성공</span><strong>{{ collection_count }}</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>규칙 후보</span><strong>{{ prefiltered_count }}</strong></div>
      <div class="metric"><span>표시 후보</span><strong>{{ candidates | length }}</strong></div>
    </section>

    <section class="candidate-list" aria-label="Shorts 후보">
      {% for candidate in candidates %}
      <article class="{{ candidate.risk_level | default('') }}">
        <div class="candidate-head">
          <div class="rank">{{ candidate.rank }}</div>
          <div>
            <h2>{{ candidate.title }}</h2>
            <div class="source">ID {{ candidate.post_id }}</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="candidate-body">
          {% if status == 'success' %}
          <h3>요약</h3>
          <p>{{ candidate.summary }}</p>
          <h3>추천 이유</h3>
          <p>{{ candidate.reason }}</p>
          <h3>예상 훅</h3>
          <p class="hook">{{ candidate.hook }}</p>
          <div class="scores">
            <div class="score"><span>재미</span><strong>{{ candidate.fun_score }}</strong></div>
            <div class="score"><span>반전</span><strong>{{ candidate.twist_score }}</strong></div>
            <div class="score"><span>명확성</span><strong>{{ candidate.clarity_score }}</strong></div>
            <div class="score"><span>Shorts 적합도</span><strong>{{ candidate.shorts_fit_score }}</strong></div>
            <div class="score"><span>종합</span><strong>{{ candidate.total_score }}</strong></div>
          </div>
          <div class="risk-row">
            <strong>위험도</strong>
            <span class="risk {{ candidate.risk_level }}">{{ candidate.risk_level }}</span>
          </div>
          {% if candidate.risks %}
          <ul>{% for risk in candidate.risks %}<li>{{ risk }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
          {% else %}<p>식별된 주요 위험 없음</p>{% endif %}
          <h3>검토 메모</h3>
          <p>{{ candidate.review_notes }}</p>
          {% else %}
          <h3>원문 일부</h3>
          <p>{{ candidate.excerpt }}</p>
          <div class="fallback-stats">
            <span>규칙 점수 {{ '%.3f' | format(candidate.rule_score or 0) }}</span>
            <span>조회 {{ candidate.views }}</span>
            <span>추천 {{ candidate.recommendations }}</span>
            <span>댓글 {{ candidate.comments }}</span>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          <a class="original" href="{{ candidate.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">원문 열기</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </section>
    <footer>원문의 주장은 사실로 확인된 내용이 아닙니다. 제작 전에 반드시 사람이 원문과 위험 요소를 다시 검토하세요.</footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
